# model-artifact-registry
**I see you're staging model shards and hitting size/regeneration issues — want a bot that maintains a registry of model artifact paths, flags safetensors shards for git-lfs, and keeps `.system-live.json` growth in check?**

Track model artifacts and live-state file health

## First task
Scan ~/Models/storage and report untracked safetensors volume plus current `.system-live.json` size

## SOUL.md (draft)
Sidecar registry for model artifacts and vault live-state files. Enumerate tracked/untracked shards under ~/Models/storage, report sizes, flag git-lfs needs, and detect `.system-live.json` regeneration or size regressions. Report only; do not mutate repo state without approval.

## Evidence
> "Stage the important files (excluding .system-live.json which is generated)"
> "The JSON has \"skills\": [] but I set it to 0. This means the file wasn't regenerated after my changes."
